SUMMARY:Interchange Message: EARLS COURT STATION: From Monday 28 September 
 until Sunday 11 October\, no step-free access to/from the eastbound 
 District line. If you are starting an eastbound step-free journey at Earls
  Court\, take a westbound train to Hammersmith and change there for an 
 eastbound train. To complete an eastbound step-free journey at Earls 
 Court: If travelling from Acton Town or Ealing Broadway\, use the 
 Piccadilly line from Acton Town. If travelling from Hammersmith\, Kew 
 Gardens or Richmond\, use the Piccadilly line from Hammersmith. If 
 travelling from Fulham Broadway\, Southfields\, Wimbledon or Wimbledon 
 Park\, take a City-bound District line train and change at Victoria for a 
 westbound train back to Earls Court
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR